    <briefdescription>
<para>A borrowed output view reporting positions relative to the wrapped stream&apos;s position at creation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Flush forwards to the wrapped stream; Close leaves it open. The wrapped stream must outlive this view. </para>
